  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/3227d04b-bf30-4c18-b119-35a6d202bb0a-image.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 215px;\" /><br /><br />Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> be the centre of the circle<br /><br />Equation of the circle is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2&#160;</mn></msup></math><br /><br />Put <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></math> in the equation of circle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Equation of circle is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />x intercept <math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
